  "language": "english",
  "text": "Sure. We have three key results for this quarter. First, reduce checkout abandonment from 18% to 12%. We are currently at 14%, so we are on track, but not finished. Second, launch the new recommendation engine, which uses the embedding model from the data science team. That one is delayed, because the vector database, we chose Pinecone, needs a security review from the compliance team. And third, achieve SOC 2 type 2 readiness. We are about halfway there. What is the risk on the SOC 2 work? The main risk is the audit logging. We need every access to customer data to be logged and retained for one year. Right now we only keep logs in CloudWatch for 30 days. We could export the logs to S3 with a live site.",
